...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

visual_assessor: 시각 분석 에이전트 (VisualAssessor) { class: ours }
design_planner: 디자인 플래너 (DesignPlanner) { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }

visual_assessor -> design_planner: 대화 기록 공유 (SequentialAgent, output_key 없음)
design_planner -> gemini: instruction + calculate_timeline 선언 + 대화 기록
gemini -> design_planner: function_call calculate_timeline(scope, room_type)
